# ─── Agent workflow doctrine — TRACKED (added 2026-09-30) ──────────────────
# The 11 agent definitions + 3 slash commands ARE the workflow. They were
# untracked, so the entire rulebook was one `rm` away from being lost and no
# clone ever received it. Commit the doctrine; ignore only runtime bloat.
# .opencode/node_modules/ is already ignored by .opencode/.gitignore.

# ─── Build output / binaries that must never be committed ───────────────────
# A 9.5 MB screen recording (20260803_110842.mp4) sat in the repo root with NO
# ignore rule, held back only by the prose rule "never `git add .`". Ignore it
# mechanically so one careless add cannot commit it permanently.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
Screenshot_*.png
screenshot_*.png

# Untracked platform scaffolding — this is an Android-only app (AGENTS.md).
# Nothing here should ever be committed.
/windows/
/.metadata
/devtools_options.yaml

